[{"id":2772639919,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6lQyCv","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Difficult to test in depth but the code makes sense and covers all the cases here","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105453#pullrequestreview-2772639919","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105453","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105453#pullrequestreview-2772639919"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105453"}},"submitted_at":"2025-04-16T13:58:04Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2772802078,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6lRZoe","user":{"login":"RandomShaper","id":11797174,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk3MTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11797174?u=a254c0fcd6cf4668367407a460e175559e12dc6f&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper","html_url":"https://github.com/RandomShaper","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Looks good.\r\n\r\nIf anything, I'd suggest making the determination of the class being thread-safe for signals or not static at compile time.\r\n\r\nSomething like this (`GDCLASS` would still need to be usable with two arguments, but you get the idea):\r\n```C++\r\n#define THREAD_SAFE_SIGNALS_FUNC_false \\\r\n    struct _ObjectSignalLock { \\\r\n        _ObjectSignalLock(void *) {} \\\r\n    };\r\n\r\n#define THREAD_SAFE_SIGNALS_FUNC_true \\\r\n    Mutex signal_mutex; \\\r\n    \\\r\n    struct _ObjectSignalLock { \\\r\n\tMutexLock lock; \\\r\n\t_ObjectSignalLock(const Object *const p_obj) : lock(p_obj.signal_mutex) {} \\\r\n};\r\n\r\n#define GDCLASS(m_class, m_inherits, m_thread_safe_signals) \\\r\n    /* [...] */ \\\r\n    THREAD_SAFE_SIGNALS_FUNC_##m_thread_safe_signals \\\r\n    /* [...] */\r\n```\r\n\r\nThat way, we'd remove the allocation and the subsequent indirection for the mutex, as well as runtime branching. `OBJ_SIGNAL_LOCK` would just be either a direct lock or no-op for non-signal-thread-safe classes.\r\n\r\nIn any case, I'm considering this an optimization that can be tackled later or by someone else.","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105453#pullrequestreview-2772802078","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105453","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105453#pullrequestreview-2772802078"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105453"}},"submitted_at":"2025-04-16T14:42:04Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2772814687,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6lRctf","user":{"login":"RandomShaper","id":11797174,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk3MTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11797174?u=a254c0fcd6cf4668367407a460e175559e12dc6f&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper","html_url":"https://github.com/RandomShaper","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I forgot to add that these should be under the lock as well:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105453/files#diff-7b1b6d9ebe2a4eabbafa4ee69f0aad4bf988539e4fe84c0f5f3bcfec78d9a8d2R2263-R2290","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105453#pullrequestreview-2772814687","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105453","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105453#pullrequestreview-2772814687"},"pull_request":{"href":"h